<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#MonetaryValue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A number of monetary units specified using a given unit of currency. Additional information: In the pre-award phase of the procurement, all monetary values are considered to exclude VAT based on the Directive 2014/24/EU."@en .
