<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/ProductsAndServices/PaymentsAndSchedules/Payee> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/ProductsAndServices/PaymentsAndSchedules/Payee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "payee" .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/ProductsAndServices/PaymentsAndSchedules/Payee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Agreements/Agreements/Obligee> .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/ProductsAndServices/PaymentsAndSchedules/Payee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:cb11abc825fc022d8780f6a9a22490d46f7352ac54e01733b9c219b452c1539b2d0 .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/ProductsAndServices/PaymentsAndSchedules/Payee> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "a party to whom a debt should be paid, or to whose order a bill of exchange, note, or check is made payable, or who receives or will receive a payment from a payer in partial or complete fulfillment of an obligation" .
